    label: "website-integrity-bot wave-20: raw-db-slug-leak guard tightened + XcelLastSyncedBadge tooltip audit-fixed. MP-245 (commit 6b1c0286) shipped XcelLastSyncedBadge two waves ago with the HTML `title` attribute reading `Most recent xcel_events row: {timestamp}` / `No xcel_events rows yet` — a raw Supabase table name leaked directly into the admin tooltip on DashboardCommandCenter, exactly the disease wave-18's raw-db-slug-leak guard was built to prevent. The guard didn't catch it because (a) `xcel_events` wasn't in the BANNED_SLUGS list, and (b) the guard's extractQuoted() helper only handled single-line quoted literals — it returned null for multi-line JSX attribute expressions like `title={ternary with template literal}`, so the whole tooltip body was invisible to the scanner. Two-part fix. Copy fix: rewrote L78-79 tooltip to `Most recent XCEL sync: {timestamp}` / `No XCEL syncs yet` (three-letter product name, zero raw-slug leak, still communicates the same freshness info). Guard fix (scripts/check-db-slug-leak.mjs): (1) added `xcel_events` to BANNED_SLUGS; (2) added a new BANNED_TABLE_ROW_PHRASE regex `/\\b[a-z][a-z0-9]*(?:_[a-z0-9]+)+\\s+(rows?|entr(?:y|ies))\\b/i` — catches the class of leak where any snake_case identifier is described in user-copy as a database row/rows/entry/entries (`agentlink_book_of_business row`, `next_step_events entries`, etc). Requires ≥1 underscore so plain English `top row` / `header row` prose doesn't false-fire; (3) rewrote extractQuoted() to fall through to a brace-balanced expression scanner when the JSX attribute value starts with `{` but the first non-whitespace char isn't a quote character — so multi-line ternaries, nested calls, and template literals with `${...}` interpolation are now fully scanned. Verified end-to-end: with the pre-fix tooltip re-injected, guard fires with `slug=\"xcel_events\"` at the correct line; with the fix restored, guard passes (553 files scanned, 0 leaks). Twentieth surface audit since wave-4; fifth consecutive class-of-fix compounding asset (wave-16 internal-nav reload-trap / wave-17 external-link tabnabbing / wave-18 raw-db-slug leak / wave-19 unguarded console-in-prod / wave-20 multi-line JSX attr slug + snake_case-row phrase). The class of leak that ripped through wave-18's guard now fails at commit time forever.",
